# VHS recording for the horizontal Linear gallery
Output examples/vhs/generated/linear-horizontal.gif

Set Theme "Aardvark Blue"
Set Width 565
Set Height 296
Set Padding 30
Set Framerate 25

Hide
Type "target/release/examples/readme linear-horizontal"
Enter
Wait+Screen /Classic/
Show
Sleep 1s
Screenshot target/vhs/linear-horizontal.png
Sleep 4920ms
